sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Local Controller (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    CSMS->>CS: PublishFirmwareRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message PublishFirmwareRequest<br>location must be <Configured firmware_location>
    CS-->>CSMS: PublishFirmwareResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Downloading)
    CSMS-->>CS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = DownloadFailed)
    CSMS-->>CS: PublishFirmwareStatusNotificationResponse
